  "discovery": {
    "_docs": "Auto-discover NEW hardware/robotics company ATS boards from the zshah101 registry (4500+ cos -> ats+slug) instead of hand-maintaining slugs. Runs in watch.py (Actions), NOT the worker. Discovered boards are KEYWORD-GATED (policy=bulk: a title must hit include_keywords) because these companies aren't hand-vetted like the curated instant tier - so noise costs nothing and only hardware/robotics-titled US roles alert. Slugs already in the curated lists are skipped (no double-alert); defense names are dropped by name_exclude + exclude_companies. ~49 new boards match today.",
    "enabled": true,
    "registry_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zshah101/Automated-List-Of-Summer-2027-and-Fall-2026-Tech-Internships/main/data/companies.json",
